      "type": "review-note",
      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-25T10:04:04Z",
      "note": "The first rfDAI transaction in the Reaper attacker campaign is 0xb928d338...22ad at block 44045743 index 4. Its trace contains four direct calls to redeem(uint256,address,address), each naming receiver 0x2c177d20...a954 and a different owner; all four owners have zero allowance to caller 0x8162a5e1...0145 at block 44045742. Two campaign receipts contain six matching Withdraw events and exactly 465578.315235863858364449 DAI. Earlier third-party withdrawals use unrelated caller/receiver pairs and are outside this campaign. Creation transaction 0xdb68cfd0...f5eb made the direct vault at block 42161064 index 1. Code is empty one block earlier, and the 16,821-byte runtime hash 0x43486e9e...202da9 is identical at creation, a midpoint, and the pre-exploit block. EIP-1967 implementation, beacon and admin slots are zero, and the exploit trace has no DELEGATECALL from the vault. The code age is 2,294,168 seconds. Loss is the exact Withdraw asset total, valued at DAI par."
    }
  ],
